    "title": "Comparison Culture, Inferiority & Superiority Cycles",
    "slug": "comparison-culture-inferiority-superiority-cycles",
    "pillar": "Identity, Ego & The Gifted Kid Trap",
    "reading_time": "15 mins",
    "target_struggle": "Endless social media status tracking, intense envy when others succeed, alternating between feelings of arrogant superiority and worthless inferiority.",
